  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v17.0.2 / v18.0.2: Updated package icon (v2 Vietnam S-map design), fixed Umbraco Marketplace metadata, and synced backoffice package manifest version. v17.0.1 / v18.0.1: Package title cleanup - the NuGet package title no longer carries the \"for Umbraco N\" suffix (the add-on keeps its descriptive name). No functional changes. v17.0.0 / v18.0.0: Initial release, shipped as two version lines — 17.x for Umbraco 17 and 18.x for Umbraco 18 — in lockstep with the core TextToSpeech package lines. Piper engine for uTPro.Feature.TextToSpeech: OS-aware binary resolution, voices discovered from the models folder, speed via length_scale, bounded run time, no shell interpolation.",
